{"id":"A1-L060","title":"Countable and uncountable nouns","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U04","focus":"Countable / uncountable — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Countable / uncountable — introdução","pron":"I am × I’m","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["stuff","too","closet","clutter","donate","junk","minimalism","belongings","overflow","sell","declutter","hanger","spare room","tidy up"],"field":"Moradia","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escuta","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 60 · Countable and uncountable nouns","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Countable / uncountable — introdução.","**Pronúncia:** I am × I’m.","**8 palavras novas** (moradia).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo distinguir substantivos contáveis e incontáveis e usar a lot of, much e many."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["stuff","coisas"],["too","demais"],["closet","closet"],["clutter","clutter"],["donate","donate"],["junk","junk"],["minimalism","minimalism"],["belongings","belongings"],["overflow","overflow"],["sell","sell"],["declutter","declutter"],["hanger","hanger"],["spare room","spare room"],["tidy up","tidy up"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Less Stuff, More Space","paras":["Many people have **too many things**. In my flat there are **a lot of** books and **many** shoes, but there is not **much** space.","Water, rice and furniture are **uncountable**: we do not say *two furnitures*. We say **a piece of furniture**.","Count what you really need. Give away the rest."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Home Weekly","gloss":[["stuff","coisas"],["furniture","mobília"],["space","espaço"],["give away","doar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The writer has too many things.","ans":"T","why":"“too many things.”"},{"q":"Furniture is countable.","ans":"F","why":"É incontável."},{"q":"The flat has a lot of space.","ans":"F","why":"“not much space.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“stuff” means…","opts":["coisas","espaço","sapatos"],"ans":0,"why":"stuff = coisas."},{"q":"“give away” means…","opts":["doar","comprar","guardar"],"ans":0,"why":"give away = doar."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Countable × uncountable","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Tipo","Exemplos","Quantidade"],"rows":[["contável","**book, shoe, egg**","**many**, **a few**, **a/an**"],["incontável","**water, rice, furniture**","**much**, **a little**, **a piece of**"]],"cap":"Countable × uncountable"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Contável tem plural (*books*). Incontável não tem plural (*water*)."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Não diga *furnitures* nem *an advice*. Diga *a piece of advice*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"There are ___ books. (many/much)","a":"many","why":"books é contável."},{"s":"There isn’t ___ space. (many/much)","a":"much","why":"space é incontável."},{"s":"I need ___ water. (a little/a few)","a":"a little","why":"água é incontável."},{"s":"A ___ of furniture. (piece/pair)","a":"piece","why":"a piece of."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["stuff","coisas"],["furniture","mobília"],["shoe","sapato"],["space","espaço"],["advice","conselho"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["furnitur